DGR-09 + API-17: out-of-memory paths of dgraphBand() and SCOTCH_dgraphBand() (status: still-present, fixed by patch 0005)
All reproducers use the shared driver repro/common/g21fi.c and the LD_PRELOAD fault shim repro/common/fishim.c (from G18).
Trees: $WORK/pristinefi = v7.0.17, $WORK/basefi = combined series (base), $WORK/buildfi = base + this series; all built
with CFLAGS "-O0 -g -fsanitize=undefined -ftrivial-auto-var-init=pattern" (ASan cannot be preloaded), see repro/common/build.sh.
  cd $WORK/repro/common && ./build.sh $WORK/pristinefi && ./build.sh $WORK/basefi && ./build.sh $WORK/buildfi
  ./scan.sh LIBDIR BIN NP FAILRANK NTH_FROM NTH_TO -- MODE TOPO BASE NL [ARGS]   (one line per failed allocation index; HANG = 15 s timeout)
Full scan outputs: repro/common/scans/pri_* (v7.0.17), base_* (combined base), fix1_*/fix2_* (patched).

Internal dgraphBand() (mode bandint), np=2 path graph, failure on rank 1:
  ./scan.sh $WORK/pristinefi/lib ./bin_pristinefi/g21fi 2 1 0 7 -- bandint path 0 8 2
    nth=2 exit=139 :: dgraphBand: out of memory (2); dgraph_band.c:224:32: runtime error: store to null pointer of type 'Gnum'  (procdsptab NULL)
    nth=3 exit=139 :: dgraphBand: out of memory (3); signal 11 on rank 1 (free of the pattern-initialized, never allocated bandfronloctab)
    nth=4 exit=1   :: out of memory (4); signal 11 on rank 1 (same)
  ./scan.sh $WORK/pristinefi/lib ./bin_pristinefi/g21fi 2 1 0 7 -- bandint path 1 8 2      (base value 1)
    nth=3..6 :: signal 6/11 on BOTH ranks: memFree (bandvnumgsttax + bandgrafptr->baseval) after dgraphFree() reset baseval to 0
Public SCOTCH_dgraphBand() (mode band):
  ./scan.sh $WORK/pristinefi/lib ./bin_pristinefi/g21fi 4 1 5 5 -- band sparse 0 4 2
    nth=5 exit=139 :: SCOTCH_dgraphBand: out of memory (2); library_dgraph_band.c:201:32: runtime error: store to null pointer of type 'Gnum'
The 64-bit overflow of the scratch array (procglbnbr Gnums gathered into MAX (vertgstnbr * 8, procglbnbr * 4) bytes) needs a 64-bit Gnum
tree with fault injection; it is read from the sizes (the 32-bit tree cannot show it since sizeof (int) == sizeof (Gnum)).
Patched (buildfi): ./scan.sh $WORK/buildfi/lib ./bin_buildfi/g21fi 2 1 0 7 -- bandint path 1 8 2  -> nth=0..6: rank 0,1: bandint rc=1; nth=7 HANG (dgraphHaloSync2, G20)
                   ./scan.sh $WORK/buildfi/lib ./bin_buildfi/g21fi 4 1 3 8 -- band sparse 1 4 2   -> nth=3..7: all ranks rc=1; nth=8 HANG (dgraphHaloSync2, G20)
